WEBVTT

observe
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Duba girma, siffa da daidaiton ƙwayoyin idanu biyu.

compare-observation
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Kwatanta ƙwayoyin idanu na al’ada da sauyin launi ko siffa, bambancin girma da fatar ido.

light
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Kunna Arclight ka zaɓi haske mafi ƙarfi. Yi amfani da ɗaki mai natsuwa da ƙarancin haske.

distance
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Ka ce majiyyaci ya kalli wani abu mai nisa.

clear-view
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Tabbatar bai kalli mai bincike ba ko hasken kansa.

move-light
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Matsar da haske daga gefe zuwa ƙwayar ido.

watch
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Duba ƙwayar idon da aka haskaka don amsarta kai tsaye.

shine-constrict
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Haskaka idon ka lura da ƙanƙancewar ƙwayar ido.

compare-responses
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Duba ko ƙanƙancewar ta ragu ko babu ita.

corresponding-examples
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Amsoshin ƙwayar ido a hagu na iya da alaƙa da cututtukan bayan ido da aka nuna a dama.

pupil-colour
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Launin ƙwayar ido ba ya ƙayyade amsarta ga haske.

cataract-constriction
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Cataract na iya sa ƙwayar ido ta yi toka ko fari, amma ya kamata ta ƙanƙance idan hanyar amsa ga haske tana aiki.
